usage: cli.py [-h] [--cookies-json COOKIES_JSON] [--proxy PROXY]
              [--account-index ACCOUNT_INDEX] [--model MODEL] [--verbose]
              [--no-persist] [--request-timeout REQUEST_TIMEOUT]
              [--skip-verify]
              {ask,reply,research,list,read,models,download,inspect} ...

CLI for gemini-webapi

positional arguments:
  {ask,reply,research,list,read,models,download,inspect}
    ask                 Single-turn question
    reply               Continue chat
    research            Deep research
    list                List chats
    read                Read chat
    models              List the models available to this account
    download            Download image
    inspect             Account probe

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --cookies-json COOKIES_JSON
                        Path to JSON cookie file
  --proxy PROXY
  --account-index ACCOUNT_INDEX
                        Google account index
  --model MODEL         Model name, alias or id (see the 'models' command).
                        Defaults to the account's default
  --verbose             Enable debug logging
  --no-persist          Do not write updated cookies back
  --request-timeout REQUEST_TIMEOUT
                        Per-request HTTP timeout in seconds
  --skip-verify         Skip SSL certificate verification
